===Darkhold: Iron Man ([[Earth-21129]])===
[[File:Anthony Stark (Earth-21129) from Darkhold Iron Man Vol 1 1 002.jpg|thumb|right]]
In this reality, [[Anthony Stark (Earth-21129)|Tony Stark]] equipped his earliest Iron Man Armor with machinery capable of repairing organs and mending bones, akin to a mobile hospital, with the intention to protect himself and help the world at large. His invention went awry when the armor's systems concluded that the suit's own iron skin was superior to human skin, and tried to replace it with itself.

