On [[Earth-61284]], the Intergalactic Iron Man Armor was created in response to [[Ronan (Earth-61284)|Ronan the Accuser]]'s arrival on [[Earth]]. The armor had rocket thrusters, allowing for space entry and travel, stronger repulsors, and could disable [[Chitauri]] shields. He promised to create a [[War Machine Armor]] variant for [[James Rhodes (Earth-61284)|War Machine]].{{r|Marvel Avengers Academy}}

