* This suit is the first armor in the [[Earth-616|Prime Marvel Universe]] to be adapted from the Marvel Cinematic Universe. While certain artists' depiction of the [[Iron Man Armor Model 42]] included a helmet design lifted from the standard Iron Man helmet outline used in the Marvel Cinematic Universe, the Model 52 is the first armor with a design taken entiretly straight from the films.
